  m_text: "After the scouting process concluded yesterday, @Marcel Trading Company
    decides to stay in @A\u2019ea decides to stay in @A\u2019ea for a while. They
    plan to open up outpost across the island to extract the resources and commercialize
    them globally. @Marcel Trading Company promise to promote our island to increase
    trade in return for allowing them  to gather resources from our island. This
    endeavor might finally put our island on the map."
